{
  "description": "<dfn class=\"text-muted\">optional, integer filter</dfn><br>Filter item prices based on their <code>trial_period</code>.<br><b>Supported operators : </b>is, is_not, lt, lte, gt, gte, between<br><br><b>Example <span class=\"cb-char-arrow\">→</span> </b><i>trial_period[is] = \"14\"</i>",
